*
*       numtcr          ieos         inopt          nmat          id2o
             1             0             1             0             0
SJC type -1 Valve with Cv table
*
*  The purpose of this test problem is to exercise the servo valve option (ivty = -1) with only forward
*  Cv tables.  The control system is used to directly adjust the flow area fraction of
*  the valve.  The valve is configured as a single face without volume (SJC component) in order to test
*  that the Cv tables work properly in that context.
*
*  This deck may generate spurious --thermh temp limit exceeded-- messages right at the beginning of the
*  transient due to an initial pressure wave that is unavoidable given the test problem configuration
*  (valve initially closed, then opens, with an imposed pressure drop via 2 break components).
*
*
